  "tail_ms": 600,
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "text": "November 2008. Ten men sailed into Mumbai. They weren't born killers. They were built — by a curriculum."
    },
    {
      "text": "Using court testimony from Ajmal Kasab and David Headley, we reconstruct how Lashkar-e-Taiba builds a fighter."
    },
    {
      "text": "A network of camps — Muridke, Muzaffarabad, Mansehra — each with a job."
    },
    {
      "text": "Daura-e-Sufa: twenty-one days of indoctrination. No guns yet."
    },
    {
      "text": "Daura-e-Aam: the basic course, and the first filter."
    },
    {
      "text": "Khidmat: two months of chores that weed out the uncommitted."
    },
    {
      "text": "Daura-e-Khaas: the stage that turns a believer into an operative."
    },
    {
      "text": "Did the state know? We separate what courts established from what is only alleged."
    },
    {
      "text": "Then, in May 2025, Operation Sindoor struck nine sites — including the compound where it all began."
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside the Terror Factory. The full documentary is out now on YouTube."
    }
  ],
